":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 76.5%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.01"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":32.59,"default_fair_val":32.59,"premium_pct":477.7,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":54.6,"pe_forward":48,"pb_trailing":11.2,"pb_forward":10.1,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":9.4,"fcf_to_ev":2.29,"fcf_to_mcap":2.67,"liab_to_assets":76.5,"cash_to_assets":3.6,"current_ratio":1.01,"roe":20.6,"roa":4.8,"moat":{"ticker":"XPO","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"XPO Logistics 的品牌在物流運輸行業中具有一定的知名度，尤其是在其核心的經紀和運輸服務領域。然而，與消費品品牌相比，其品牌影響力在客戶決策中的權重相對較低，客戶更看重服務的可靠性、價格和效率。因此，定價權相對有限，難以大幅超出市場平均水平，但其品牌在爭取客戶和建立信任方面仍有一定價值。","comment_en":"XPO Logistics possesses a recognized brand within the logistics and transportation sector, particularly in its core brokerage and transportation services. However, compared to consumer brands, its brand influence carries less weight in customer decision-making, where reliability, price, and efficiency are paramount. Consequently, pricing power is somewhat limited, making it difficult to significantly exceed market averages, though the brand still holds value in securing clients and building trust."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"物流運輸行業的進入壁壘主要來自於資本投入、運營網絡和客戶關係，而非專利或特許經營權。XPO 的業務模式不依賴於技術專利，監管環境雖然存在，但並未形成顯著的、可持續的競爭壁壘。公司主要依賴運營效率和規模來獲取競爭優勢，而非受專利保護的獨特技術或服務。","comment_en":"Barriers to entry in the logistics and transportation industry stem primarily from capital investment, operational networks, and customer relationships, rather than patents or regulatory franchises. XPO's business model does not rely on technological patents. While regulations exist, they do not form a significant, sustainable competitive barrier. The company relies on operational efficiency and scale for competitive advantage, not on patent-protected unique technologies or services."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"對於依賴 XPO 服務的客戶而言，更換供應商會帶來顯著的轉換成本。這包括重新談判合同、整合新的系統、培訓員工以及潛在的服務中斷風險。特別是對於那些將 XPO 整合到其供應鏈關鍵環節的客戶，轉換成本會更高。這種粘性為 XPO 提供了一定的客戶留存能力和定價支持。","comment_en":"For customers relying on XPO's services, switching providers incurs substantial switching costs. This includes renegotiating contracts, integrating new systems, training staff, and the potential risk of service disruption. The costs are particularly high for clients who have integrated XPO into critical parts of their supply chains. This stickiness provides XPO with a degree of customer retention capability and pricing support."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"XPO 的網絡效應體現在其日益增長的貨運經紀業務中。隨著平台連接的貨運商和發貨人越多，平台的匹配效率和價值就越高，吸引更多用戶。然而，這種網絡效應相對較弱，因為市場參與者眾多，且貨運商和發貨人可以同時與多個平台合作。其核心的運輸服務網絡效應不顯著。","comment_en":"XPO's network effects are evident in its growing freight brokerage business. As more carriers and shippers connect to the platform, its matching efficiency and value increase, attracting more users. However, this network effect is relatively weak due to the numerous market participants and the ability of carriers and shippers to engage with multiple platforms simultaneously. Network effects are not significant in its core transportation services."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"作為一家大型綜合物流服務提供商，XPO 在規模經濟方面具有顯著優勢。其龐大的運輸網絡、採購能力和運營效率使其能夠以低於小型競爭對手的成本運營。通過整合收購和優化網絡，XPO 持續擴大其規模優勢，從而在價格和服務範圍上獲得競爭力。","comment_en":"As a large, integrated logistics service provider, XPO possesses a significant advantage in economies of scale. Its vast transportation network, purchasing power, and operational efficiencies enable it to operate at a lower cost than smaller competitors. By integrating acquisitions and optimizing its network, XPO continuously expands its scale advantage, gaining competitiveness in pricing and service scope."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"XPO 的業務遍布北美和歐洲，擁有廣泛的地理覆蓋。然而，其資產（如倉庫、車隊）在很大程度上是可替代的，並且其地理位置的優勢並非獨一無二，競爭對手也能輕易複製。雖然廣泛的網絡有利於運營，但並未形成難以逾越的地理壁壘。","comment_en":"XPO operates across North America and Europe, boasting extensive geographic coverage. However, its assets, such as warehouses and fleets, are largely replicable, and its geographic positioning does not offer unique advantages that competitors cannot easily duplicate. While a broad network aids operations, it does not constitute an insurmountable geographic barrier."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"XPO 在運營效率方面表現出色，這得益於其對技術的投資和持續的流程優化。通過先進的調度系統、實時追踪和數據分析，公司能夠最大化運輸效率，降低空駛率，並優化路線。這種卓越的運營能力是其核心競爭力之一，使其能夠在成本和服務質量上超越許多同行。","comment_en":"XPO excels in operational efficiency, driven by its investment in technology and continuous process optimization. Through advanced dispatch systems, real-time tracking, and data analytics, the company maximizes transportation efficiency, minimizes empty miles, and optimizes routes. This superior operational capability is one of its core competencies, allowing it to outperform many peers in both cost and service quality."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"XPO 的管理層在過去展現了較為積極的資本配置策略，包括通過戰略性收購擴大規模和優化業務組合。雖然過去的收購整合帶來了挑戰，但整體而言，管理層在剝離非核心資產和聚焦高增長領域方面表現出一定的戰略眼光。未來能否持續創造股東價值仍需觀察。","comment_en":"XPO's management has demonstrated a relatively aggressive capital allocation strategy in the past, including expanding scale and optimizing its business portfolio through strategic acquisitions. While past acquisition integrations have presented challenges, management has generally shown strategic foresight in divesting non-core assets and focusing on high-growth areas. Its ability to consistently create shareholder value going forward remains to be seen."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"結合了高轉換成本（M3）和卓越的運營效率（M7），XPO 在客戶保留方面表現良好。一旦客戶習慣了 XPO 的服務流程和可靠性，並且將其整合到自身運營中，他們通常會傾向於維持現狀。持續提供高質量的服務和具有競爭力的價格是維持客戶忠誠度的關鍵。","comment_en":"Combined with high switching costs (M3) and excellent operational efficiency (M7), XPO performs well in customer retention. Once clients become accustomed to XPO's service processes and reliability, and integrate them into their own operations, they tend to maintain the status quo. Consistently providing high-quality service and competitive pricing are key to sustaining customer loyalty."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"XPO 的業務模式相對穩定，不易受到短期經濟波動的劇烈影響，因為物流是現代經濟的基礎設施。然而，行業競爭激烈，技術變革（如自動駕駛、供應鏈數字化）可能帶來長期顛覆性風險。其護城河的持久性取決於公司持續適應行業變革和維持運營優勢的能力。","comment_en":"XPO's business model is relatively stable and not severely impacted by short-term economic fluctuations, as logistics is fundamental infrastructure for the modern economy. However, the industry is highly competitive, and technological advancements (like autonomous driving and supply chain digitalization) pose potential long-term disruptive risks. The durability of its moat depends on the company's ability to continuously adapt to industry changes and maintain its operational advantages."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"XPO Logistics 的護城河主要建立在其規模經濟、卓越的運營效率以及客戶因轉換成本而產生的粘性之上。這使其在物流運輸行業中具備了類似『收費橋』的特徵，即客戶依賴其網絡和服務來實現高效運轉，更換成本高昂。雖然其品牌知名度有助於爭取業務，但並非核心壁壘。公司缺乏專利或顯著的網絡效應，地理資產也非獨一無二。其競爭優勢更多體現在運營層面的執行力，而非難以複製的特許經營權。未來需關注其持續優化成本結構和服務能力，以應對行業變革和競爭壓力。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"XPO Logistics' moat is primarily built upon its economies of scale, superior operational efficiency, and customer stickiness driven by switching costs. This gives it 'toll bridge'-like characteristics within the logistics and transportation industry, where customers rely on its network and services for efficient operations, making replacement costly. While its brand recognition helps in securing business, it's not a core barrier. The company lacks patents or significant network effects, and its geographic assets are not unique. Its competitive advantage lies more in operational execution than in irreplicable franchises. Future success hinges on continued cost structure optimization and service capability enhancement to navigate industry changes and competitive pressures.","evidenceHash":"24ca222e57412ba99e950fab6bf90c842fe06b91b978eef57eab1a7ee42e06eb","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"safe","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"4e3610e263303501a3cc432a99570b9c687a06c30dac25d1fa09c4d4fb9faa45"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"4e3610e263303501a3cc432a99570b9c687a06c30dac25d1fa09c4d4fb9faa45"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/XPO.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/XPO.png","website":"https://www.xpo.com","ceo":"Mario A. Harik","full_time_employees":"38000","description":"XPO Logistics, Inc. is a prominent provider of freight shipping solutions, operating extensively across the United States, wider North America, various European nations including France and the United Kingdom, and globally. The company's business activities are structured into two primary divisions. The North American LTL (Less-Than-Truckload) segment delivers crucial LTL services, guaranteeing timely and geographically comprehensive transportation for regional, inter-regional, and cross-continental freight. This division also handles cross-border shipments connecting the U.S. with Mexico and Canada, alongside domestic services within Canada. Its second division, Brokerage and Other Services, focuses on the crucial final leg of delivery for substantial goods purchased through e-commerce platforms, omnichannel retail, and direct-to-consumer channels. Furthermore, this segment provides brokered freight services that fall outside its core operations. XPO serves a wide range of industries, including industrial and manufacturing, retail and e-commerce, food and beverage, logistics and general transportation, and consumer goods. Founded in 2000, the company is headquartered in Greenwich, Connecticut.","description_en":"XPO Logistics, Inc. is a prominent provider of freight shipping solutions, operating extensively across the United States, wider North America, various European nations including France and the United Kingdom, and globally. The company's business activities are structured into two primary divisions. The North American LTL (Less-Than-Truckload) segment delivers crucial LTL services, guaranteeing timely and geographically comprehensive transportation for regional, inter-regional, and cross-continental freight. This division also handles cross-border shipments connecting the U.S. with Mexico and Canada, alongside domestic services within Canada. Its second division, Brokerage and Other Services, focuses on the crucial final leg of delivery for substantial goods purchased through e-commerce platforms, omnichannel retail, and direct-to-consumer channels. Furthermore, this segment provides brokered freight services that fall outside its core operations. XPO serves a wide range of industries, including industrial and manufacturing, retail and e-commerce, food and beverage, logistics and general transportation, and consumer goods. Founded in 2000, the company is headquartered in Greenwich, Connecticut.","description_zh":"**XPO Logistics, Inc. (XPO) 業務營運概述**\n\nXPO Logistics, Inc. 為一家領先的貨運解決方案供應商，業務遍及美國、北美、歐洲（包括法國、英國）及全球。公司營運主要劃分為兩大事業群：\n\n1.  **北美 LTL (Less-Than-Truckload) 事業群：** 提供關鍵的零擔貨運服務，確保區域性、跨區域及跨大陸貨物的即時且廣泛的運輸。此事業群亦負責美國與墨西哥、加拿大之間的跨境貨運，以及加拿大境內的國內運輸服務。\n\n2.  **經紀與其他服務事業群：** 專注於電子商務平台、全通路零售及直銷通路所購置大型商品的關鍵「最後一哩路」配送。此外，此事業群亦提供非核心業務的貨運經紀服務。\n\nXPO 的服務對象涵蓋工業製造、零售與電子商務、食品飲料、物流運輸及消費品等多樣化產業。公司成立於 2000 年，總部位於康乃狄克州格林威治。","address":"Five American Lane","city":"Greenwich","state":"CT","zip":"06831","country":"US","phone":"855 976 6951","full_address":"Five American Lane, Greenwich, CT 06831, US","range_52w":"121.48-232.05","year_high":232.05,"year_low":121.48,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":121.48,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Bates David J.","title":"officer: Chief Operating Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":700,"price":175.77,"total_val":0.12},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Bates David J.","title":"officer: Chief Operating Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":300,"price":176.64,"total_val":0.05},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Bates David J.","title":"officer: Chief Operating Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":900,"price":178.66,"total_val":0.16},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Bates David J.","title":"officer: Chief Operating Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":715,"price":179.66,"total_val":0.13},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Wismans Kyle","title":"officer: Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":750,"price":175.47,"total_val":0.13},{"date":"2026-09-15","name":"Bates David J.","title":"officer: Chief Operating Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":200,"price":177.26,"total_val":0.04},{"date":"2026-09-15","name":"Bates David J.","title":"officer: Chief Operating Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":400,"price":178.07,"total_val":0.07},{"date":"2026-09-15","name":"Bates David J.","title":"officer: Chief Operating Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":1500,"price":179.65,"total_val":0.27},{"date":"2026-09-15","name":"Bates David J.","title":"officer: C